{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FAST: Casters of Chaos</strong> is a top-down party game where you fight as <strong>time travellers</strong>. Everyone has different <strong>powers connected with time or space</strong>: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gija</strong>, the ancient druid lady can reverse time and create magical gates that increase the size of matter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Andree</strong>, the handsome gladiator can use the power of titans to increase its speed. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forn</strong>, the ice technomancer is able to create frost walls and slow the flow of time around. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Saturii</strong>, the scientist from the future who using technology creates black holes and energy barriers. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join the tournament and fight for glory and blessings of titans!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3896080?t=1765023364","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3896080?t=1765023364","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896080/e40054be9bddf1582538881e11d2d9216ca37ac6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765023364","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896080/e40054be9bddf1582538881e11d2d9216ca37ac6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765023364","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","